{"id":"wb-1-87","name":"清净寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"清净寺","text":"清净寺（闽南语白话字：Chheng-chēng-sī）位于中国福建省泉州市鲤城区涂门街，又称艾苏哈卜大寺（阿拉伯语：مسجد الأصحاب）、圣教寺、麒麟寺、圣友寺，当地俗称礼拜寺（Lé-pài-sī），讹为马拜寺（Bé-pài-sī），是中国现存最早的阿拉伯建筑风格的清真寺，1961年被列为第一批全国重点文物保护单位。文化大革命期间清净寺和圣墓受到严重损毁，文革后修复。2021年，作为“泉州：宋元中国的世界海洋商贸中心”的组成部分入选世界文化遗产。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B8%85%E5%87%80%E5%AF%BA","revisionId":94249170,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94249170","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/7394235097f11b06a9f0e873.jpg","title":"20230130_Qingjing_Mosque_01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20230130_Qingjing_Mosque_01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/60/20230130_Qingjing_Mosque_01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Qingjing Mosque in Quanzhou","width":320,"height":213}}